#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): 'Wait 1 ms' inside a 90 ms loop is built inline and is exact (it used to be rejected as a library call)
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 180,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat For 90 ms
    Wait 1 ms
End Repeat

Do
Loop
